        "description": "After phase 1 is reviewed, develop the additional setup needed for components requiring data or services. Users and agents author sample data; automatic generation is lowest priority. Use existing or purposefully authored data models. Services expose APIs with substitutable implementations and inspectable calls. Decide save/discard behavior with the user before implementation and keep sample state separate from real buildspace data. Real data remains deferred until strict read-only guarantees are designed. Preserve generic contributor ownership and no per-component editor adapters.",
